# A read, a store or a copy enters an accessor, and no call is written there. The flow knows every place that enters one which an operation lays on a literal or on a class object, so it has every caller known,
# but no list of callees has those places. In the order in which a program starts such a function is entered by whoever looks a name up where nobody can say what answers.
# If `lateForGetter` lost the mark of emptiness, the getter would go through the empty word: it did, and the process died by a signal.
# `behind` is stored in front of the first call of its reader and keeps its proof.
# RUN: link variables mechanisms=all
# CHECK: variable g3 proven=L2 writers-known
# CHECK: variable g4 proven=absent|L2
# CHECK: variable g5 proven=absent|L2
# CHECK: variable g6 proven=absent|L2

